    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bayraktar and Stugna",
    "steam_appid": 3757410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a fighter of modern warfare in Bayraktar and Stugna, a military simulator with an emphasis on gameplay diversity, where each mode is a separate combat mission with its own atmosphere and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enter the battle on the legendary Bayraktar, using missiles and time dilation to destroy waves of enemy equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the position of the Stugna-P operator and accurately strike enemy columns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Switch to FPV drones - control strike, loitering or kamikaze drones to accurately hit targets on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Act as an artillery commander - choose firing points, buy new self-propelled guns and watch the spectacular implementation of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In MLRS mode, you control a multiple launch rocket system - cover enemy concentration areas with a barrage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take control of the air defense system, destroy drones, missiles, helicopters and aircraft, and discover new types of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the helm in Aviation mode and clear the map of enemy air and ground forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Conduct a counterattack - launch tanks, infantry, drones, aircraft, special equipment into battle, use missile strikes and electronic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Feel like an infantryman - choose one of several classes (SSO, sniper, engineer, medic, etc.), capture points, use equipment and drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf All your results are saved - track the destroyed equipment and enemies in the general statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 completely different game modes - bayraktars, stugns, fpv-drones, artillery, MLRS, air defense, aviation, counterattack, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress and improvement system: unlock new equipment, weapons, abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical capabilities: time slowing, air strikes, electronic warfare, equipment repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of types of equipment: Bayraktar, Stugna, self-propelled guns, MLRS, FPV drones, aircraft, anti-aircraft guns, tanks, armored personnel carriers, infantry fighting vehicles, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed statistics of all destroyed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events - a dedication to modern Ukrainian defenders.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a fighter of modern warfare in Bayraktar and Stugna, a military simulator with an emphasis on gameplay diversity, where each mode is a separate combat mission with its own atmosphere and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enter the battle on the legendary Bayraktar, using missiles and time dilation to destroy waves of enemy equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the position of the Stugna-P operator and accurately strike enemy columns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Switch to FPV drones - control strike, loitering or kamikaze drones to accurately hit targets on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Act as an artillery commander - choose firing points, buy new self-propelled guns and watch the spectacular implementation of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In MLRS mode, you control a multiple launch rocket system - cover enemy concentration areas with a barrage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take control of the air defense system, destroy drones, missiles, helicopters and aircraft, and discover new types of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the helm in Aviation mode and clear the map of enemy air and ground forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Conduct a counterattack - launch tanks, infantry, drones, aircraft, special equipment into battle, use missile strikes and electronic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Feel like an infantryman - choose one of several classes (SSO, sniper, engineer, medic, etc.), capture points, use equipment and drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf All your results are saved - track the destroyed equipment and enemies in the general statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 completely different game modes - bayraktars, stugns, fpv-drones, artillery, MLRS, air defense, aviation, counterattack, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress and improvement system: unlock new equipment, weapons, abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical capabilities: time slowing, air strikes, electronic warfare, equipment repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of types of equipment: Bayraktar, Stugna, self-propelled guns, MLRS, FPV drones, aircraft, anti-aircraft guns, tanks, armored personnel carriers, infantry fighting vehicles, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed statistics of all destroyed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events - a dedication to modern Ukrainian defenders.</p>",
    "short_description": "Bayraktar and Stugna is a multi-mode war arcade game where you take part in the fight against enemy forces using modern technology and tactics. Control drones, artillery, aircraft or infantry - each mode offers a unique style of play!",
